  "reference_steps": [
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_001",
      "source": "x = F.pad(x, self.padding_size, mode='constant', value=0)",
      "semantics": [
        "使用常量 0 对输入 x 进行 padding，pad 顺序为 (left, right, top, bottom) 应用于最后两维。",
        "输出形状 [1024,1,515,259]，填充区域为 0。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "checkpoint": "step_002",
      "source": "x = torch.mean(x, dim=self.channels)",
      "semantics": [
        "沿 dim=1 (channels) 求均值，由于该维度大小为 1，输出等于移除该维度。",
        "输出形状 [1024,515,259]。"
